CM_ SG_ 2147545114 EngnFlAttr1CntrlCmmnd "Engine Fuel Actuator 1 Control Command: The control command to fuel actuator 1, normalized to percent, where 0% represents fully closed and 100% represents fully open. In applications where the fuel actuator controls to differential pressure, 0% repr...";
CM_ SG_ 2147545114 EngnThrttlAttr2CntrlCmmnd "Engine Throttle Actuator 2 Control Command: The control command to throttle actuator 2, normalized to percent, where 0% represents fully closed and 100% represents fully open.  Typically, this throttle actuator is used to regulate air or air / fuel m...";
CM_ SG_ 2147545114 EngnThrttlAttr1CntrlCmmnd "Engine Throttle Actuator 1 Control Command: The control command to throttle actuator 1, normalized to percent, where 0% represents fully closed and 100% represents fully open.  Typically, this throttle actuator is used to regulate air or air / fuel m...";
