CM_ BO_ 2147548777 "Engine Temperature 3";
CM_ SG_ 2147548777 EngnChrgArClr1OtltTmprtr "Engine Charge Air Cooler 1 Outlet Temperature: Temperature of combustion air after it exits from the Charge Air Cooler 1 but before any mixing of recirculated exhaust gas.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548777 EngnIntkVlvAttnSstmOlTmprtr "Engine Intake Valve Actuation System Oil Temperature: The temperature of the oil in the hydraulic system that powers the intake valve actuation system.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548777 EngnClntTmprtrHghRsltn "Engine Coolant Temperature (High Resolution): Temperature of liquid found in engine cooling system. The higher resolution is required for control purposes.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548777 EngnIntkMnfld1TmprtrHghRsltn "Engine Intake Manifold 1 Temperature (High Resolution): Temperature of pre-combustion air found in intake manifold of engine air supply system. The higher resolution is required for control purposes.";
